{
  "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
  "duration_s": 427.0,
  "generated_at": "2026-09-04T02:59:41.839491+00:00",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0000",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 0,
      "start_s": 0.111,
      "end_s": 3.674,
      "text": "This crow is hurling itself at a man's head, screaming in his face.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0001",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 1,
      "start_s": 4.055,
      "end_s": 4.715,
      "text": "So is that one.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0002",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 2,
      "start_s": 4.935,
      "end_s": 5.496,
      "text": "And that one.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0003",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 3,
      "start_s": 5.656,
      "end_s": 11.301,
      "text": "On a single walk across one college campus, 47 of the 53 crows he passed broke off to come after him.",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0004",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 4,
      "start_s": 11.421,
      "end_s": 13.363,
      "text": "But the crows are not really after the man.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0005",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 5,
      "start_s": 13.503,
      "end_s": 15.465,
      "text": "They are after the rubber mask on his face.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0006",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 6,
      "start_s": 15.645,
      "end_s": 18.247,
      "text": "Take the mask off, and they ignore him completely.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0007",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 7,
      "start_s": 18.368,
      "end_s": 21.45,
      "text": "Put it back on, and they come screaming every time.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0008",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 8,
      "start_s": 21.59,
      "end_s": 23.112,
      "text": "What did he do to deserve this?",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0009",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 9,
      "start_s": 23.432,
      "end_s": 31.495,
      "text": "Eight years ago, for a study on how crows recognize faces, he put on a rubber mask, trapped seven of them, and let them go unharmed minutes later.",
      "n_words": 28
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0010",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 10,
      "start_s": 31.635,
      "end_s": 35.456,
      "text": "Put on a different mask and walk the same path, and the crows ignore you completely.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0011",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 11,
      "start_s": 35.616,
      "end_s": 37.397,
      "text": "It is that one face they want.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0012",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 12,
      "start_s": 37.677,
      "end_s": 38.877,
      "text": "That was the whole crime.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0013",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 13,
      "start_s": 38.937,
      "end_s": 42.399,
      "text": "Yet, most of the crows coming after him today were never trapped.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0014",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 14,
      "start_s": 42.659,
      "end_s": 44.621,
      "text": "Many were not even alive when it happened.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0015",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 15,
      "start_s": 44.761,
      "end_s": 48.523,
      "text": "So, how does a bird hold a grudge against a face most of them have never even seen?",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0016",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 16,
      "start_s": 48.723,
      "end_s": 49.784,
      "text": "They inherit it.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0017",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 17,
      "start_s": 49.944,
      "end_s": 54.667,
      "text": "The first crows taught their chicks which face to attack, and those chicks taught theirs.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0018",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 18,
      "start_s": 54.927,
      "end_s": 58.989,
      "text": "It gets handed down, generation after generation, like a family heirloom.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0019",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 19,
      "start_s": 59.049,
      "end_s": 60.911,
      "text": "It does not even stop at family.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0020",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 20,
      "start_s": 60.971,
      "end_s": 66.334,
      "text": "When one crow starts screaming, the others fly in to see what the fuss is, and they learn the enemy on the spot.",
      "n_words": 23
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0021",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 21,
      "start_s": 66.514,
      "end_s": 72.46,
      "text": "These birds have hated one human face for longer than most friendships last, and most of them have no idea why.",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0022",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 22,
      "start_s": 72.6,
      "end_s": 77.204,
      "text": "So if a bird has ever screamed at you and no one else nearby, that was probably not random.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0023",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 23,
      "start_s": 77.404,
      "end_s": 81.048,
      "text": "You did something once that it never forgot, and crows are only the beginning.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0024",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 24,
      "start_s": 81.168,
      "end_s": 89.055,
      "text": "The deeper you go, the stranger and darker this gets, until you reach an animal that knew a man on sight after years in the wild, when it had every reason to kill him.",
      "n_words": 34
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0025",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 25,
      "start_s": 89.235,
      "end_s": 90.937,
      "text": "It does not even take a clever bird.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0026",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 26,
      "start_s": 91.037,
      "end_s": 94.54,
      "text": "The same memory turns up in animals we write off as too stupid to notice anything.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0027",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 27,
      "start_s": 94.66,
      "end_s": 95.38,
      "text": "Like the pigeon.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0028",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 28,
      "start_s": 95.62,
      "end_s": 96.761,
      "text": "The flying rat.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0029",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 29,
      "start_s": 96.981,
      "end_s": 99.303,
      "text": "In a park, two researchers fed the same flock.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0030",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 30,
      "start_s": 99.563,
      "end_s": 100.304,
      "text": "One was gentle.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0031",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 31,
      "start_s": 100.544,
      "end_s": 102.586,
      "text": "The other chased them over and over.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0032",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 32,
      "start_s": 102.766,
      "end_s": 107.349,
      "text": "Then they switched roles, and to make it harder, they swapped jackets so the colors were reversed.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0033",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 33,
      "start_s": 107.469,
      "end_s": 109.251,
      "text": "Could the pigeons still tell them apart?",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0034",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 34,
      "start_s": 109.591,
      "end_s": 109.951,
      "text": "Easily.",
      "n_words": 1
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0035",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 35,
      "start_s": 110.131,
      "end_s": 112.413,
      "text": "They kept their distance from the one who used to chase them.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0036",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 36,
      "start_s": 112.633,
      "end_s": 114.014,
      "text": "no matter whose jacket he had on.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0037",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 37,
      "start_s": 114.114,
      "end_s": 115.355,
      "text": "They were not reading the clothes.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0038",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 38,
      "start_s": 115.736,
      "end_s": 116.817,
      "text": "They were reading the face.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0039",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 39,
      "start_s": 117.137,
      "end_s": 120.64,
      "text": "And these were ordinary wild pigeons that had never been caught or trained.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0040",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 40,
      "start_s": 120.86,
      "end_s": 122.061,
      "text": "Nobody taught them to do this.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0041",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 41,
      "start_s": 122.321,
      "end_s": 125.184,
      "text": "To the pigeon on the sidewalk, you are not part of the scenery.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0042",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 42,
      "start_s": 125.384,
      "end_s": 131.229,
      "text": "You might already be a face it has filed away, but a bird remembering whether you were kind or cruel is one thing.",
      "n_words": 23
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0043",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 43,
      "start_s": 131.449,
      "end_s": 133.771,
      "text": "What about an animal that remembers the look on your face?",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0044",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 44,
      "start_s": 134.011,
      "end_s": 138.215,
      "text": "Researchers showed a group of horses a single photograph of a person making an angry face.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0045",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 45,
      "start_s": 138.395,
      "end_s": 141.516,
      "text": "Hours later, that same person walked into the stable in the flesh.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0046",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 46,
      "start_s": 141.876,
      "end_s": 142.537,
      "text": "Calm now.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0047",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 47,
      "start_s": 142.937,
      "end_s": 143.317,
      "text": "Neutral.",
      "n_words": 1
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0048",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 48,
      "start_s": 143.557,
      "end_s": 144.737,
      "text": "Nothing on their face at all.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0049",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 49,
      "start_s": 144.938,
      "end_s": 146.138,
      "text": "The horses were not fooled.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0050",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 50,
      "start_s": 146.358,
      "end_s": 152.721,
      "text": "They watched that person warily, turning to study them with the left eye, the one wired straight to the part of the brain that handles threats.",
      "n_words": 26
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0051",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 51,
      "start_s": 153.001,
      "end_s": 158.823,
      "text": "They had never met this human, they had seen one picture of them in a bad mood, and they had already decided to keep an eye on them.",
      "n_words": 28
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0052",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 52,
      "start_s": 159.063,
      "end_s": 163.985,
      "text": "A horse can hold your worst moment against you, from a photograph before you have said a single word.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0053",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 53,
      "start_s": 164.165,
      "end_s": 166.326,
      "text": "And that is a big mammal with a big brain.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0054",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 54,
      "start_s": 166.666,
      "end_s": 169.967,
      "text": "surely something with almost no brain at all would be safe to ignore you.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0055",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 55,
      "start_s": 170.147,
      "end_s": 170.647,
      "text": "Think again.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0056",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 56,
      "start_s": 170.948,
      "end_s": 175.989,
      "text": "An octopus has no bones, three hearts, blue blood, and most of its brain spread out through its arms.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0057",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 57,
      "start_s": 176.309,
      "end_s": 178.97,
      "text": "It is about as close to an alien as anything on this planet.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0058",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 58,
      "start_s": 179.17,
      "end_s": 180.791,
      "text": "It can still pick you out of a crowd.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0059",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 59,
      "start_s": 180.971,
      "end_s": 184.932,
      "text": "In one experiment, a tank of octopuses met two keepers in identical uniforms.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0060",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 60,
      "start_s": 185.252,
      "end_s": 187.893,
      "text": "One fed them, the other poked them with a bristly stick.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0061",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 61,
      "start_s": 188.053,
      "end_s": 188.874,
      "text": "It did not take long.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0062",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 62,
      "start_s": 189.034,
      "end_s": 192.795,
      "text": "The octopuses started reaching out for the nice keeper and shrinking away from the mean one.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0063",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 63,
      "start_s": 192.975,
      "end_s": 196.776,
      "text": "and they began aiming a hard jet of water at the one they had learned to dislike.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0064",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 64,
      "start_s": 197.017,
      "end_s": 205.28,
      "text": "In another lab, an octopus took against one staff member for no reason anyone could see, and soaked her with a blast of water down the neck every time she walked past.",
      "n_words": 32
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0065",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 65,
      "start_s": 205.56,
      "end_s": 210.162,
      "text": "A creature with a mind nothing like ours, looking up at a human and thinking, not you again.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0066",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 66,
      "start_s": 210.362,
      "end_s": 211.942,
      "text": "So far, every one of these is a grudge.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0067",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 67,
      "start_s": 212.182,
      "end_s": 214.903,
      "text": "But memory cuts both ways, and this is where it gets beautiful.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0068",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 68,
      "start_s": 215.164,
      "end_s": 217.745,
      "text": "Back to the crows, because a crow keeps two lists.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0069",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 69,
      "start_s": 218.085,
      "end_s": 221.346,
      "text": "One for the people it cannot forgive, and one for the people it loves.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0070",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 70,
      "start_s": 221.626,
      "end_s": 226.067,
      "text": "In Seattle, a little girl named Gabby started feeding the crows in her yard when she was four.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0071",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 71,
      "start_s": 226.327,
      "end_s": 231.989,
      "text": "Scraps on the way to the bus, a full birdbath, every day like clockwork, and the crows started paying her back.",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0072",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 72,
      "start_s": 232.229,
      "end_s": 241.632,
      "text": "They left her gifts on the feeder, beads, buttons, an earring, a shard of polished glass, and a tiny piece of metal stamped with the word BEST, like half of a friendship charm.",
      "n_words": 33
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0073",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 73,
      "start_s": 241.852,
      "end_s": 243.472,
      "text": "Crows do not normally do this.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0074",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 74,
      "start_s": 243.772,
      "end_s": 246.273,
      "text": "Most people who feed them get nothing but more crows.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0075",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 75,
      "start_s": 246.493,
      "end_s": 247.513,
      "text": "Gabby got treasures.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0076",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 76,
      "start_s": 247.773,
      "end_s": 250.354,
      "text": "Then her mother lost a lens cap in a nearby alley.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0077",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 77,
      "start_s": 250.674,
      "end_s": 254.135,
      "text": "Days later, it turned up on the feeder, right where the crows leave their gifts.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0078",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 78,
      "start_s": 254.495,
      "end_s": 257.015,
      "text": "They had found the thing her family lost and carried it home.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0079",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 79,
      "start_s": 257.235,
      "end_s": 259.876,
      "text": "To those crows, Gabby was not a random kid in a yard.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0080",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 80,
      "start_s": 260.116,
      "end_s": 261.476,
      "text": "She was a face worth keeping.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0081",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 81,
      "start_s": 261.596,
      "end_s": 264.777,
      "text": "So animals remember the faces that fed them, and the faces that hurt them.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0082",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 82,
      "start_s": 264.877,
      "end_s": 267.378,
      "text": "But how long can a memory like that actually last?",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0083",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 83,
      "start_s": 267.638,
      "end_s": 269.838,
      "text": "For that, look at the animals closest to us.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0084",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 84,
      "start_s": 270.118,
      "end_s": 276.32,
      "text": "Chimpanzees and bonobos' red faces almost exactly the way you do, and they almost never let one go.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0085",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 85,
      "start_s": 276.58,
      "end_s": 283.561,
      "text": "In one study, apes were shown photos of old groupmates and people they had not seen in years, and their attention went straight to the familiar face.",
      "n_words": 27
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0086",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 86,
      "start_s": 283.941,
      "end_s": 287.282,
      "text": "One bonobo picked out relatives she had not seen in 26 years.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0087",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 87,
      "start_s": 287.462,
      "end_s": 291.003,
      "text": "That is the longest face memory ever recorded in any animal but us.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0088",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 88,
      "start_s": 291.243,
      "end_s": 298.033,
      "text": "They have even recognized specific humans after decades apart, with half the face hidden behind a mask and still known exactly who they were.",
      "n_words": 24
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0089",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 89,
      "start_s": 298.153,
      "end_s": 303.06,
      "text": "To an ape, a face you showed it once can still be sitting in its head a quarter of a century later.",
      "n_words": 22
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0090",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 90,
      "start_s": 303.201,
      "end_s": 305.784,
      "text": "But remembering a face for that long is one thing.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0091",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 91,
      "start_s": 306.245,
      "end_s": 309.227,
      "text": "The deepest memory of all is not about how long it lasts.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0092",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 92,
      "start_s": 309.488,
      "end_s": 310.448,
      "text": "It is about love.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0093",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 93,
      "start_s": 310.729,
      "end_s": 312.41,
      "text": "This is the moment from the very start.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0094",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 94,
      "start_s": 312.61,
      "end_s": 317.374,
      "text": "The animal that knew a man after years in the wild, when it had every reason to kill him.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0095",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 95,
      "start_s": 317.474,
      "end_s": 322.558,
      "text": "In 1969, two young Australians walked into an exotic animal store and bought a lion cub.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0096",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 96,
      "start_s": 322.698,
      "end_s": 325.24,
      "text": "They named him Christian and raised him in the middle of the city.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0097",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 97,
      "start_s": 325.44,
      "end_s": 327.521,
      "text": "in the basement of the furniture shop where they worked.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0098",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 98,
      "start_s": 327.661,
      "end_s": 339.244,
      "text": "But a lion does not stay small, so they did the hardest thing they could and gave him a wild life, handing him to a conservationist named George Adamson, who taught a city-raised cub how to be a real lion in the Kenyan bush.",
      "n_words": 44
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0099",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 99,
      "start_s": 339.544,
      "end_s": 340.204,
      "text": "A year passed.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0100",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 100,
      "start_s": 340.324,
      "end_s": 346.346,
      "text": "Christian was a wild lion now, leading his own pride, hunting his own food, hundreds of miles from the life he was born into.",
      "n_words": 24
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0101",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 101,
      "start_s": 346.526,
      "end_s": 349.787,
      "text": "And the two men flew back to Africa to find out if he would even remember them.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0102",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 102,
      "start_s": 350.027,
      "end_s": 351.468,
      "text": "Everyone told them it was pointless.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0103",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 103,
      "start_s": 351.748,
      "end_s": 353.089,
      "text": "A year is a long time.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0104",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 104,
      "start_s": 353.229,
      "end_s": 356.07,
      "text": "Christian was a grown wild male who had met other people since.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0105",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 105,
      "start_s": 356.31,
      "end_s": 357.11,
      "text": "He might not know them.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0106",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 106,
      "start_s": 357.271,
      "end_s": 357.931,
      "text": "He might charge.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0107",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 107,
      "start_s": 358.131,
      "end_s": 359.832,
      "text": "They climbed onto a rock and waited.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0108",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 108,
      "start_s": 360.052,
      "end_s": 364.774,
      "text": "Christian came forward slowly, head low, studying them the way a wild lion studies a stranger.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0109",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 109,
      "start_s": 364.954,
      "end_s": 366.415,
      "text": "For a moment, nobody breathed.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0110",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 110,
      "start_s": 366.615,
      "end_s": 368.517,
      "text": "And then he stopped pretending to be wild.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0111",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 111,
      "start_s": 368.777,
      "end_s": 376.042,
      "text": "He broke into a run, rose onto his back legs, threw his paws over their shoulders, and pushed his head into their faces like an overgrown house cat.",
      "n_words": 28
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0112",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 112,
      "start_s": 376.282,
      "end_s": 377.943,
      "text": "A year apart, a whole new life.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0113",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 113,
      "start_s": 378.224,
      "end_s": 379.364,
      "text": "And he knew them instantly.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0114",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 114,
      "start_s": 379.545,
      "end_s": 383.968,
      "text": "Even his lionesses, who had never trusted a human, let the two men walk right up.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0115",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 115,
      "start_s": 384.148,
      "end_s": 386.25,
      "text": "Because Christian had decided they were family.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0116",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 116,
      "start_s": 386.45,
      "end_s": 388.151,
      "text": "He had spent a year turning wild.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0117",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 117,
      "start_s": 388.391,
      "end_s": 391.693,
      "text": "None of it had touched the part of him that remembered the two men who raised him.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0118",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 118,
      "start_s": 391.833,
      "end_s": 396.776,
      "text": "To almost everyone you pass today, you are a face in a crowd, gone the second you turn the corner.",
      "n_words": 20
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0119",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 119,
      "start_s": 396.996,
      "end_s": 398.617,
      "text": "But that is a human way of seeing it.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0120",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 120,
      "start_s": 398.857,
      "end_s": 406.421,
      "text": "A crow might know your face, a pigeon might know your walk, and somewhere, an animal you have completely forgotten still has not forgotten you.",
      "n_words": 25
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0121",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 121,
      "start_s": 406.601,
      "end_s": 413.845,
      "text": "You were never interchangeable to them, you were a specific person, remembered, and quietly judged, long after you forgot the moment ever happened.",
      "n_words": 23
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0122",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 122,
      "start_s": 414.045,
      "end_s": 417.547,
      "text": "The kindness you showed an animal years ago might still be waiting to be repaid.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0123",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 123,
      "start_s": 417.707,
      "end_s": 418.812,
      "text": "And so might the cruelty.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0124",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 124,
      "start_s": 418.973,
      "end_s": 422.348,
      "text": "So the next time you feel watched by something out there, you are probably right.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0125",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 125,
      "start_s": 422.569,
      "end_s": 425.342,
      "text": "Somewhere out there, an animal is still keeping score.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I:s0126",
      "video_id": "jBM7m-LcT2I",
      "idx": 126,
      "start_s": 425.482,
      "end_s": 426.366,
      "text": "And it knows your face.",
      "n_words": 5
    }
  ]
}